ore choices"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"4"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"independent judges"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"judging-eligibility","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"eligibility-intro","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index light","children":"Pass / fail · Zero points"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["Eligibility",["$","br",null,{}],"gates."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"These determine who reaches the final round. Once a project passes, judges begin from the same starting line. Functionality is a gate—not a scored bonus."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"eligibility-list","children":[["$","article","01",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Clean start"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Ideas and teams may exist beforehand. Code, prototypes, design artifacts, and project work begin on Saturday."}]]}]]}],["$","article","02",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Runs live"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The project itself runs during review. A video, slide deck, or mockup cannot stand in for the working build."}]]}]]}],["$","article","03",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Claims have evidence"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"If a feature or Codex contribution cannot be shown when asked, judges score as though that claim was not made."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"criteria-list","aria-labelledby":"criteria-title","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"judging-section-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"What judges score"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"criteria-title","children":["Three questions.",["$","br",null,{}],"Thirty points."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Each criterion is worth the same amount. Breadth, polish, and ambition matter only when they produce a better, more thoughtful build."}]]}],[["$","article","01",{"className":"criterion","children":[["$","header",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Codex Craft"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Did the team use Codex deeply, appropriately, and demonstrably, not merely as one-shot code generation?"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"criterion-look-for","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Look for"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Specific artifacts, sessions, decisions, steering, recovery from failure, and visible payoff. Breadth counts only when it served the work."}]]}]]}]]}],"$L7","$L8"]}],"$L9","$La"]]}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]}]
7:["$","div",null,{"className":"anchor-grid","aria-label":"Codex Craft score anchors","children":[["$","div","10",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Exceptional"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Codex materially shaped several meaningful parts of the build. The team shows strong evidence, explains how it steered the work, and chose capabilities because they fit the task."}]]}]]}],["$","div","8",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"8"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Above the bar"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Codex carried substantial work across the build, including purposeful use beyond routine generation. Concrete evidence shows a clear payoff."}]]}]]}],["$","div","7",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"7"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Solid finalist"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Codex contributed meaningfully, but mostly through routine or one-shot use. Evidence is limited or the team’s steering is difficult to see."}]]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"5"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Not demonstrated"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Codex use is thin, incidental, or only asserted. The team cannot point to a specific contribution and its visible result."}]]}]]}]]}]
8:["$","p",null,{"className":"capability-note","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Examples:"}]," planning, research, coding, debugging, testing, review, terminal work, parallel agents, and visual or multimodal input."]}]
9:["$","article","02",{"className":"criterion","children":[["$","header",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Product Judgment"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Did the team choose the right scope and turn it into one coherent, complete core experience?"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"criterion-look-for","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Look for"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A clear job, deliberate priorities, sensible boundaries, and cuts that protect the core experience instead of scattering effort."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"anchor-grid","aria-label":"Product Judgment score anchors","children":[["$","div","10",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Exceptional"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Exceptionally focused and coherent. The team made excellent cuts and completed the experience that matters most."}]]}]]}],["$","div","8",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"8"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Above the bar"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A complete, well-chosen core experience with sensible boundaries. Secondary work supports rather than distracts from it."}]]}]]}],["$","div","7",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"7"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Solid finalist"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A usable core exists, but scope or priorities feel somewhat scattered. Several choices compete for attention."}]]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"5"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Weak"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The pieces exist, but they do not yet form a coherent product experience. The team built around the core instead of completing it."}]]}]]}]]}],false]}]
a:["$","article","03",{"className":"criterion","children":[["$","header",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Problem & Insight"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Is the project grounded in a specific problem and audience, with a thoughtful or non-obvious approach?"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"criterion-look-for","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Look for"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A named audience, evidence or firsthand knowledge, a solution aimed at the cause of the pain, and choices that are right, not merely different."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"anchor-grid","aria-label":"Problem & Insight score anchors","children":[["$","div","10",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Exceptional"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A specific audience and pain are backed by evidence or firsthand knowledge. The solution addresses the cause, with a non-obvious choice the team can defend."}]]}]]}],["$","div","8",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"8"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Above the bar"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A real problem, plausible audience, and solution that clearly addresses it. The project’s distinct angle survives questioning."}]]}]]}],["$","div","7",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"7"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Solid finalist"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The problem is broad or generic. The solution is reasonable but interchangeable, and answers about the user stay abstract."}]]}]]}],["$","div","5",{"className":"score-anchor","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"5"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Not demonstrated"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The problem is asserted rather than grounded. It feels like technology looking for a use, with no clear answer to who needs it and why."}]]}]]}]]}],false]}]
b:["$","section",null,{"className":"section demo-checklist judging-process","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"The scale"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["Seven is",["$","br",null,{}],"honorable."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A 7 means solid finalist work. An 8 means clearly above the finalist bar. A 10 is exceptional and should be rare. A 5 means the criterion was weak or not demonstrated."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Watch and ask."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Every team gets the same core question: “Show us one thing Codex did today that materially improved this project.”"}]]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Score provisionally."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Each judge records 10, 8, 7, or 5 for all three criteria immediately after the pitch."}]]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Calibrate once."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"After all five teams, judges may revise their own scores against the written anchors. They do not negotiate a shared score."}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
c:["$","section",null,{"className":"judging-principle","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Score the work and the judgment behind it."}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Do not reward presentation charisma, polished slides, team size, prior experience, huge scope, feature count, or trendy technology by itself."}]]}]
d:["$","section",null,{"className":"rules-grid judging-final-notes","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"rules-card dark-card","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index light","children":"Tie-break"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["Codex Craft",["$","br",null,{}],"first."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Higher combined Codex Craft score, then more 10s across all judge scores, then more 8s. If still tied, use the head judge’s ranking recorded before totals are revealed."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"rules-card lime-card","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-index","children":"Remember"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["Proof beats",["$","br",null,{}],"claims."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"If a feature or Codex contribution cannot be shown when asked, judges score as though that claim was not made."}]]}]]}]
